      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i mean i know i should probably talk to someone but it just feels like such a massive effort to even try. like i have to explain everything from the beginning and it's just so exhausting to keep performing. it feels like im just going through the motions of a life that doesnt even belong to me anymore. i just want everything to be quiet.",
